From b929c248ab16018d1f35a5f6a840336634bf4c38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gavin John <gavinnjohn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 19:34:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08/64] demux: asf: do not dereference the file properties when
 they are gone

DemuxEnd() leaves p_sys->p_fp NULL, which happens when a chained header
fails to re-initialise: Demux() tears the old one down and cannot build the
replacement. The demux object stays open and the input keeps polling it.

DEMUX_GET_POSITION is reached in that state, and its guards do not help -
i_time is not reset by the teardown, and i_length is zero, which is the
branch falling through to demux_vaControlHelper() and
p_fp->i_min_data_packet_size. The default case below guards the same
dereference with a ternary; guard this one the same way.

MainLoopStatistics() issues DEMUX_GET_POSITION every 250 ms, so it is a
crash rather than a failed control.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 modules/demux/asf/asf.c | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/modules/demux/asf/asf.c b/modules/demux/asf/asf.c
index 2ab028f2cc..1862faa818 100644
--- a/modules/demux/asf/asf.c
+++ b/modules/demux/asf/asf.c
@@ -523,11 +523,16 @@ static int Control( demux_t *p_demux, int i_query, va_list args )
             *pf = p_sys->i_time / (double)p_sys->i_length;
             return VLC_SUCCESS;
         }
+        /* p_fp is NULL once DemuxEnd() has run, which happens when a chained
+         * header fails to re-initialise. The default case below guards the
+         * same dereference; this one did not, and the input polls
+         * DEMUX_GET_POSITION every 250 ms. */
         return demux_vaControlHelper( p_demux->s,
                                        __MIN( INT64_MAX, p_sys->i_data_begin ),
                                        __MIN( INT64_MAX, p_sys->i_data_end ),
                                        __MIN( INT64_MAX, p_sys->i_bitrate ),
-                                       __MIN( INT16_MAX, p_sys->p_fp->i_min_data_packet_size ),
+                                       ( p_sys->p_fp ) ?
+                                       __MIN( INT16_MAX, p_sys->p_fp->i_min_data_packet_size ) : 1,
                                        i_query, args );
 
     case DEMUX_SET_POSITION:
